  "content": {
    "title": "Tiger Woods and Vanessa Trump share a kiss at TGL finals in Florida",
    "text": "March 25, 2026Updated March 26, 2026, 9:23 a.m. ETGolf great Tiger Woods, and Vanessa Trump, the former wife of Donald Trump Jr., went 'Instagram official' on March 23, 2025.\"Love is in the air and life is better with you by my side! We look forward to our journey through life together.\" Woods stated in the 2025 social post.And recently, love WAS in the air for the celebrity couple, as the two shared a romantic moment before Woods competed in the TGL match against Los Angeles Golf Club during the golf finals in Palm Beach Gardens. Woods was returning to competition for the first time since Dec. 2024.Vanessa, 48, and her daughter, Kai Trump were seen clapping and cheering for Woods while in the stands at the SoFi Center.See Tiger Woods and Vanessa Trump share a romantic moment at the TGL finals in Palm Beach GardensWhat to know about Vanessa Trump, who is dating Tiger WoodsFormer model Vanessa Haydon, formerly Vanessa Kay Pergolizzi, is best known for being married to Donald Trump Jr. She took her stepfather's last name, Haydon, when she was modeling.President Donald Trump introduced his son to Vanessa Trump at a fashion show in 2003. The couple married Nov. 12, 2005, at Donald Trump's private club, Mar-a-Lago in Palm Beach, Florida.In spring 2025, Vanessa Trump and Tiger Woods, announced their relationship via Instagram, a practice known as \"Instagram official.\" Their children know each other: Kai Trump and Tiger Woods' children with ex-wife/former model Elin Nordegren − Sam Alexis Woods and Charlie Woods − attended the same school in Florida.See Serena Williams and other celebrities at the TGL Finals at SoFi Center in Palm Beach GardensAmong the A-listers at the TGL Finals on March 24 were Serena Williams, Vanessa and Kai Trump and Charlie Woods.See the full list of celebrities at the TGL finals.",
